{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"2de647657242e26143c107178b4c40c94c7391dc5a0d2f98449e2d99f19cc71b","ja":"伝説のショコラティエ？","zh":"传说中的巧克力大师？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"32c50895275cf5fe738f60c49ed771555327630f7bb2542dd4b707adfdd07a47","ja":"女王様！　\n伝説のショコラティエ様を見つけました～！","zh":"女王陛下！　\n我找到传说中的巧克力大师了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fcdb03daf1663e1419a3283cb52f87d2431c3f406c17f996410d06b4ede0b491","ja":"なんと……！　よくやりましたね。\n確かに、語り継がれてきた容姿と瓜二つです！","zh":"天哪……！干得真漂亮。\n确实和传说中流传的容貌一模一样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"724248920f5dfc3e4edb8d4461acf1af3360046798f36b38a14a3ab1a73fe3ef","ja":"（紗代子さん……じゃ、ないんだよね……？）","zh":"（不是……纱代子吧……？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9d199df322d4c3b4d200708d8b808dae2422a8f0e0e31a88298d8317b8ab7763","ja":"あの……伝説の……ショコラティエって……？","zh":"那个……传说中的……巧克力大师是……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2866622c3081f111d133a5890dfbb131a14337c12a30f61f9de84c54a6932017","ja":"昔、この国に現れたショコラティエのことです。\n数多の試練を乗り越え、究極のチョコを作った者……。","zh":"那是很久以前，出现在这个国家的巧克​​力师傅。\n一个克服了重重考验，制作出终极巧克力的人……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"109240be9ed7b1dafe113dc6c171469aa93360c20f5603e914a03e33bb50506c","ja":"みんなの憧れの人なんです！\nでも、その姿を見た人はとっても少なくて……。","zh":"她是大家的憧憬之人！\n但是，见过她身姿的人非常少……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d962e27f97cc715f6c733b7655f106d2a63ac4b1387373c3d69307867fdf1fee","ja":"だから私、お会いできてすっごく感激してますっ！\nそれも、このタイミングで来てくれるなんて！","zh":"所以我能见到您真的超级感动！\n而且，您居然在这个时候赶过来了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b91ada1c140010fb77a1c6f7416f0cb0ffa034e2c43660b0b02fc0a22a847d25","ja":"現在、チョコの国では、長く続く干ばつで\nチョコの材料となる農作物に被害が出ているのです。","zh":"如今，巧克力之国因长期的干旱，\n导致制作巧克力的农作物原料受到了损害。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cfa0741215771f9f97ff4305d8293818d51a8b268d9d6fc11ff536de06660fd3","ja":"森の奥深くにいる大精霊に究極のチョコを奉納すれば、\n雨を降らせてくれると言われているのですが……。","zh":"据说只要向森林深处的大精灵奉纳终极巧克力，\n它就会降下雨水，然而……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"a2fa86e4da33ab992e55e87cf381312c49b07178d5330458205358d31ab79501","ja":"（え……もしかして……その、すごいチョコを……\n作るのって……）","zh":"（诶……难道说……那个，做超厉害的巧克力……\n是指……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"08339241764360bb701e709444ccde4b3ed0d8b710b609689d0e818b8bb8ac86","ja":"この国には究極のチョコを作れる人がいません。\nだからあなたに作ってほしいんです！","zh":"这个国家里没有能做出终极巧克力的人。\n所以希望你能帮我们做！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:06:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ca392a1026d411099ed9bc5af166aec0b5d384ecf3e0b753852850bdf284c87b","ja":"や、やっぱり……！？　でも……杏奈、\nそんなすごいの……作れない、と……思います……。","zh":"果、果然……！？　但是……杏奈，\n我觉得……我做不出那么厉害的东西……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c18d823af6a628c3008d082de1a914b1032e71e582548359d47b6c93402e8ec1","ja":"大丈夫です！　なんたって伝説のショコラティエ様\nですから！　ちょちょいのちょいですよ～～！","zh":"没问题！　毕竟可是传说中的巧克力大师\n所以说！　小菜一碟啦～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"70021024b5d48773074d6c34135543ff21b3e0f4812c8880d313de52248e422b","ja":"さっそく準備しましょう！\nささっ、どうぞお着替えください！","zh":"那就赶快准备吧！\n来来来，请快换衣服吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"06345cd728a61d4abf6e42df7de7ca8c3a3df5dab6c78bbe70da1f78a517aea0","ja":"えへへっ♪　すっごく似合ってますよ、\nショコラティエ様♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪　超级适合您哦，\n巧克力师大人♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"790e23737e7f7041dc1cfc26ae48272c3dd8cff37df46b05e6bdd2fc95d3e99d","ja":"（あ……衣装に着替えたら……\nなんだか……力が、湧いてきた……！？）","zh":"（啊……换上服装之后……\n总觉得……力量，涌上来了……！？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"d082f77f27e373f024b843022a3b89c89f132ac68fa1123e3d166b71ebf0771b","ja":"イェーイ！　スイートでビターなマジカル\nショコラティエ杏奈、ビビッと登場！","zh":"耶——！甜蜜又苦涩的魔法\n巧克力师杏奈，闪亮登场！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1003.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e7bbb36a28a7b1cc8aa78a857a6d42753d39348b9a5c5c2cf02d27ff7ca89a92","ja":"杏奈にビビッとお任せだよ～～～！","zh":"交给杏奈，包在我身上啦～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:23:50+00:00"}
